qpwgraph, a Qt6 graph/patchbay GUI for PipeWire: see and rewire every audio and MIDI node. Qt Widgets, so it runs on your software-only Qt6 (QT_QPA_PLATFORM=wayland). Built without the system tray icon and the single-instance check (both need QtNetwork).
